00:01:46.573 --> 00:01:48.028
- Yeah, yeah.
- Yeah.

00:01:48.028 --> 00:01:48.528
Just by...

00:01:48.528 --> 00:01:49.510
- That's so interesting.

00:01:49.510 --> 00:01:51.860
- [Viktor] Yeah when you
just for a population.

00:01:53.590 --> 00:01:54.980
Yeah.

00:01:54.980 --> 00:01:58.760
- Yeah, and so I wonder,
do you think that with,

00:01:58.760 --> 00:02:01.210
if we now we're going
