the extensive death rate

00:02:17.940 --> 00:02:22.940
that we're seeing here
compared to other places is,

00:02:23.310 --> 00:02:25.880
in part because of some
of these comorbidities?

00:02:25.880 --> 00:02:30.853
Or do you think it's more
related to mismanagement of,

00:02:32.760 --> 00:02:36.220
