testing or things like that?

00:02:36.220 --> 00:02:38.300
- Or even health management?

00:02:38.300 --> 00:02:40.070
- Yeah.
- Yeah.

00:02:40.070 --> 00:02:42.700
Yeah, absolutely, I think
