00:04:52.020 --> 00:04:53.520
So yeah, one major yeah,.

00:04:53.520 --> 00:04:58.350
They did advocate for that, but again,

00:04:58.350 --> 00:05:00.250
a really big limitation of the study

00:05:00.250 --> 00:05:01.890
